cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Crucible in research or build on it, please cite as below."
title: "Crucible: Multi-Agent Adversarial AI Review on AMD MI300X"
abstract: >-
  Crucible is a multi-agent adversarial review engine that runs six
  architecturally distinct open-source LLM families in parallel on a
  single AMD MI300X GPU. Each model plays a different reviewer persona;
  findings are scored by inter-architecture agreement and emitted as
  structured JSON with verbatim evidence quotes per finding.
